### States reproduced (parity with features/dashboard/widgets/APIUsageWidget.tsx) ###
  loading  -> size-aware skeleton chrome (big-number skeleton when compact; stat-grid skeletons otherwise)
  empty    -> ContentUnavailableView 'No API usage data' (web EmptyState, BarChart2 icon) — never a blank box
  error    -> error icon + 'Couldn''t load API usage' + message + Retry (web WidgetShell QueryError branch)
  stale    -> amber 'Stale' freshness chip + 'Reconnecting' banner over cached metrics
  offline  -> muted 'Offline' freshness chip + 'Offline' banner over cached metrics
  content  -> compact single-number 'Calls (24h)' (+ red error line when errorRate>5),
              or 4-up stat grid (Total Calls / Avg Response / Error Rate / Errors),
              cols = isWide(size.cols>=3) ? 4 : 2; danger tint when errorRate>5 / errorCount>0;
              '↓ High' trend chip on Error Rate only above the >5 threshold.

